          "english_quote": "you shall have it read",
          "issue": "The lexical metadata lists a causative rendering as an alternative for ἀναγνωσῇ. The selected clause assigns the reading to Hermas himself, together with the elders; it does not say that he will arrange for someone else to read. The future middle form does not by itself support that change of agency. The chosen main-text rendering preserves the source, but this advertised alternative does not.",
